://web.archive.org/web/20251115220431/https://looksmax.org/threads/oral-castor-oil.1629569/"},{"title":"how to use castor oil and its benefits for hair","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/how-to-use-castor-oil-and-its-benefits-for-hair.1589451/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20250914120751/https://looksmax.org/threads/how-to-use-castor-oil-and-its-benefits-for-hair.1589451/"},{"title":"oral castor oil question","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/oral-castor-oil-question.1581884/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251018164056/https://looksmax.org/threads/oral-castor-oil-question.1581884/"},{"title":"is castor oil cope or should i slap it on my eyebrows and goattee","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/is-castor-oil-cope-or-should-i-slap-it-on-my-eyebrows-and-goattee.1575112/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251018100035/https://looksmax.org/threads/is-castor-oil-cope-or-should-i-slap-it-on-my-eyebrows-and-goattee.1575112/"},{"title":"minoxidil and castor oil","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/minoxidil-and-castor-oil.1492034/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20250916065112/https://looksmax.org/threads/minoxidil-and-castor-oil.1492034/"},{"title":"is castor oil cope","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/is-castor-oil-cope.1372281/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20250403081957/https://looksmax.org/threads/is-castor-oil-cope.1372281/"},{"title":"1 months eyelash transformation on castor oil","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/1-months-eyelash-transformation-on-castor-oil.1223237/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251012030024/https://looksmax.org/threads/1-months-eyelash-transformation-on-castor-oil.1223237/"},{"title":"topical or oral castor oil","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/topical-or-oral-castor-oil.1027984/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20240519112202/https://looksmax.org/threads/topical-or-oral-castor-oil.1027984/"},{"title":"oral minox vs oral castor oil","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/oral-minox-vs-oral-castor-oil.951242/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20240318113050/https://looksmax.org/threads/oral-minox-vs-oral-castor-oil.951242/"},{"title":"gonna start using rosemary and castor oil for eyebrows and eyelashes any tips","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/gonna-start-using-rosemary-and-castor-oil-for-eyebrows-and-eyelashes-any-tips.941624/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20240318112523/https://looksmax.org/threads/gonna-start-using-rosemary-and-castor-oil-for-eyebrows-and-eyelashes-any-tips.941624/"}],"news":[],"social":[{"title":"Almond Blossom","url":"https://lemmy.world/post/27331789","site":"Lemmy · artshare","score":91,"comments":5,"year":2025},{"title":"Fact check: Is Sam Altman right that almonds use more water than ChatGPT queries? (Spoiler: No)","url":"https://lemmy.dbzer0.com/post/74981016","site":"Lemmy · fediverse_vs_disinfo","score":47,"comments":5,"year":2026},{"title":"Reducing the syntactic castor-oil in Objective C","url":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=2636420","site":"Hacker News","score":1,"comments":0,"year":2011}],"web":[{"title":"Almond oil","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Almond_oil"},{"title":"Castor oil","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Castor_oil"}]},"angle":{"goal":"Eyes & eye area","chain":["Oil massaged under eyes","Skin moisturised and softened","Smoother, less shadowed under-eye"],"effect":"claimed","text":"Users massage almond or castor oil under the eyes to moisturize, soften fine lines and reduce the look of dark circles. The oils soften and hydrate thin skin, which can look smoother. Both are common cosmetic carriers."},"wikipedia":null,"grokipedia":null,"lead":["Almond oil and castor oil are plant oils that some people massage into the skin under the eyes, with the aims of moisturising, reducing the look of dark circles and softening fine lines.","Sweet almond oil is used as a carrier oil in cosmetics and aromatherapy; about 70 percent of its fat is monounsaturated, mainly oleic acid, and it contains vitamin E.[1] Castor oil is pressed from Ricinus communis seeds, and about 90 percent of its fatty acids are ricinoleates; it is used as a moisturiser in creams.[2]","No clinical trial of either oil applied to the periorbital area was found. Reference sources describe their general cosmetic use without evidence for appearance outcomes.[1][2]"],"infobox":[["Type","Plant oil emollients"],["Almond oil","Mostly oleic and linoleic acids; vitamin E"],["Castor oil","About 90% ricinoleate"],["Clinical trials","None found for this use"]],"sections":[{"h":"Composition","paras":["Almond oil is pressed from sweet or bitter almond kernels; the sweet type is the cosmetic carrier oil, while bitter almond oil contains benzaldehyde and is used for flavouring and perfume.[1] Castor oil's polar ricinoleic acid makes it unusual among vegetable oils.[2]"],"subs":[]},{"h":"Claims","paras":["Proponents say regular gentle massage with either oil nourishes thin eyelid skin and lightens circles. Reference articles do not provide evidence for these appearance effects.[1][2]"],"subs":[]},{"h":"Safety","paras":["Almonds can cause allergy and intolerance with cross-reactivity to other tree nuts and peach allergens.[1] Castor oil is regarded as non-toxic after processing because heating during extraction deactivates ricin.[2]"],"subs":[]},{"h":"Clinical studies","paras":["No studies found."],"subs":[]}],"lore":null,"timeline":[],"refs":[{"title":"Almond oil","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Almond_oil","source":"Wikipedia","year":2026,"type":"encyclopedia"},{"title":"Castor oil","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Castor_oil","source":"Wikipedia","year":2026,"type":"encyclopedia"}],"studies":[],"reddit":[],"forums":[{"title":"Castor oil on eyebrows/lashes","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/castor-oil-on-eyebrows-lashes.1768759/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251218000750/https://looksmax.org/threads/castor-oil-on-eyebrows-lashes.1768759/"},{"title":"castor oil + rosemary oil cope?","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/castor-oil-rosemary-oil-cope.1767452/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251218164542/https://looksmax.org/threads/castor-oil-rosemary-oil-cope.1767452/"},{"title":"Castor oil is not cope","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/castor-oil-is-not-cope.1760243/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251218013136/https://looksmax.org/threads/castor-oil-is-not-cope.1760243/"},{"title":"castor oil","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/castor-oil.1758725/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251228112022/https://looksmax.org/threads/castor-oil.1758725/"},{"title":"castor oil","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/castor-oil.1753885/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20260113184355/https://looksmax.org/threads/castor-oil.1753885/"},{"title":"castor oil for eyelashes","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/castor-oil-for-eyelashes.1736346/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251218075240/https://looksmax.org/threads/castor-oil-for-eyelashes.1736346/"},{"title":"castor oil ricinus oil","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/castor-oil-ricinus-oil.1698278/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20260103054047/https://looksmax.org/threads/castor-oil-ricinus-oil.1698278/"},{"title":"castor oil for styling","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/castor-oil-for-styling.1548208/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251014162021/https://looksmax.org/threads/castor-oil-for-styling.1548208/"},{"title":"castor oil the most misunderstood looksmax and why minoxidil sucks","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/castor-oil-the-mos